{"time": "2026-06-08T23:02:14", "event": "post_written", "user_id": "c_graph_drift_g003_a03_14f1725b_003", "post_id": "74cjfvl", "subreddit": "news", "content": "I am so exhausted by the constant theatricality in Congress. Every routine budget vote is treated like a hostage situation now. Can we please just elect people who are interested in the boring, day-to-day work of governing instead of trying to go viral on cable news? I just want the lights kept on without the manufactured drama."}
