{"time": "2026-06-08T23:03:48", "event": "post_written", "user_id": "c_graph_drift_g003_a03_14f1725b_005", "post_id": "ghqoxkg", "subreddit": "GlobalTalk", "content": "Every new proposal to 'freeze' the frontlines in Ukraine feels incredibly naive. You can't just draw a line on a map and call it a day. A frozen conflict doesn't mean peace, it just means leaving millions of people in limbo until the next escalation."}
